+# Review boundaries
+#
+# 1. No operation config is derived from the mutable global OpenAPI object.
+# 2. dockerLoginImageRegistry has no default global-service fallback.
+# 3. Existing global ImageRegistriesService callers need a separately named
+#    legacy adapter during migration; omission must not compile silently.
+# 4. External-only work without a client performs zero Cloudflare API requests
+#    and follows the existing warning/public-pull fallback.
+# 5. Mocked request tests must contaminate global TOKEN, USERNAME, PASSWORD,
+#    HEADERS, ENCODE_PATH, and LOGGER, then prove none enters the scoped request.
+# 6. Tests must capture request config at dispatch and prove secrets are absent
+#    from logs, errors, snapshots, and retained artifacts.
